The loop lemma independently closes with `#Top`. The entry theorem is intentionally dependent on that circularity; a claim-filtered entry-only run is still executing because filtering removes its induction lemma. I’m letting it reach a bounded diagnostic outcome, then I’ll verify the dependency-aware full spec exactly as submitted.
